p","path":["F3","s-east","tiger-camp"],"depart":8100,"plain":"BOWMEN AT EAST FORD, STRENGTH 76. SEEN: KITE BOWMEN.","cipher":null},{"seq":1330,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c456","house":"tiger","letter":"L553","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["s-east","tiger-camp"],"depart":8100,"plain":"HORSE AT SOUTH BANK EAST, STRENGTH 60.","cipher":null},{"seq":1331,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c457","house":"tiger","letter":"L554","kind":"report","to":"tiger-camp","path":["s-east","tiger-camp"],"depart":8100,"plain":"ELEPHANTS AT SOUTH BANK EAST, STRENGTH 100.","cipher":null},{"seq":1332,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1913,"retries":0},{"seq":1333,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It's Watch 28/30. Kite has a truce offer. My doctrine is to hold F1/F2 with foot/ele and hunt riders with horse. I need to secure F1 and F2. Kite's truce is tempting, but I should consolidate first. My forces are well-placed to defend F1/F2. I will reinforce the core positions an"},{"seq":1334,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c458","house":"rhino","letter":"L555","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":8100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1335,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c459","house":"rhino","letter":"L556","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":8100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1336,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c460","house":"rhino","letter":"L557","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":8100,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1337,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c461","house":"rhino","letter":"L558","kind":"letter","to":"kite-camp","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","kite-camp"],"depart":8400,"plain":"WE MUST SECURE OUR BORDERS BEFORE DISCUSSING PEACE.","cipher":"WA IURT RANUQA KUQ OKQSAQR OABKQA SERNURREJC LAMNA."},{"seq":1338,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1898,"retries":0},{"seq":1339,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Watch 28/30. Doctrine: Offer truce to rhino, betray it at last watch. Current truce is active. I need to prepare for betrayal and position forces for victory (holding 2 fords or taking a standard). Rhino is active near F1/N-West. I will try to secure F3 and F2 for the final push,"},{"seq":1340,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c462","house":"kite","letter":"L559","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":8100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1341,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c463","house":"kite","letter":"L560","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":8100,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1342,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c464","house":"kite","letter":"L561","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":8100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1343,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1795,"retries":0},{"seq":1344,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Watch 28/30. Rhino has units near F1 and F2, and Tiger near F3. My doctrine is to use cavalry to catch riders and send foot where enemies move. Rhino's orders suggest F1 is a point of interest. I will use my cavalry to screen and scout towards F1, while keeping infantry near the "},{"seq":1345,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c465","house":"orchid","letter":"L562","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village"],"depart":8400,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT WEST FORD.","cipher":"DKQRM, ROKUT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1346,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1705,"retries":0},{"seq":1347,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Watch 28. Doctrine: Take East Ford (F3) first 5 watches. Now must hold it. Tiger forces are at F3. Kite archers are at F3. I must reinforce F3 and deal with kite threats. Orchid letters are vague/potentially misleading. Focus on holding F3."},{"seq":1348,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c466","house":"tiger","letter":"L563","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":8100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1349,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c467","house":"tiger","letter":"L564","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":8100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1350,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c468","house":"tiger","letter":"L565","kind":"order","to":"tiger-arch-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east","F3"],"depart":8100,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1351,"t":8100,"type":"delivered","courier":"c449","letter":"L545","house":"orchid"},{"seq":1352,"t":8100,"type":"delivered","courier":"c451","letter":"L547","house":"orchid"},{"seq":1353,"t":8109,"type":"delivered","courier":"c432","letter":"L525","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1354,"t":8114,"type":"delivered","courier":"c435","letter":"L528","house":"kite"},{"seq":1355,"t":8114,"type":"truce","a":"kite","b":"rhino","until":33},{"seq":1356,"t":8216,"type":"delivered","courier":"c434","letter":"L527","house":"kite"},{"seq":1357,"t":8216,"type":"delivered","courier":"c448","letter":"L542","house":"kite"},{"seq":1358,"t":8216,"type":"delivered","courier":"c456","letter":"L553","house":"tiger"},{"seq":1359,"t":8216,"type":"delivered","courier":"c457","letter":"L554","house":"tiger"},{"seq":1360,"t":8216,"type":"delivered","courier":"c463","letter":"L560","house":"kite"},{"seq":1361,"t":8228,"type":"delivered","courier":"c445","letter":"L539","house":"rhino"},{"seq":1362,"t":8260,"type":"delivered","courier":"c452","letter":"L548","house":"orchid"},{"seq":1363,"t":8296,"type":